{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a customizable Shopify Featured Product section based closely on the existing Luxe theme Featured Product layout.
    
    DESIGN:
    - Maintain the Luxe theme's clean, spacious two-column layout and existing site typography.
    - Product information on the left and product image on the right.
    - Both columns should have a white background.
    - Add a customizable green outer frame/background visible around the section and between columns.
    - Stack responsively on mobile.
    
    SECTION HEADER:
    Add an optional section header above the two-column product area with:
    - Editable heading
    - Optional subheading
    - Optional link + link label
    - Show/hide setting
    - Editable left, center, or right alignment
    - Editable spacing above/below
    
    PRODUCT CONTENT:
    Left column should include:
    1. Product title
    2. Dynamic price
    3. Custom rich-text description
    4. Optional Learn More link
    5. Icon + text callouts
    6. Add to Bag button
    
    Allow independent alignment controls for:
    - Product content: left, center, or right
    - Section header: left, center, or right
    - Icon callout area: left, center, or right
    - Add to Bag button: left, center, right, or full width
    - Product image: left, center, or right
    
    ICON CALLOUTS:
    Add up to 4 customizable icon callout blocks directly above the Add to Bag button.
    
    Each callout should include:
    - Custom uploaded icon or built-in icon
    - Editable heading
    - Editable supporting text
    - Optional URL
    - Setting to make the heading/text clickable
    - Optional setting to make the entire callout clickable
    - Editable icon size/color
    - Editable text colors
    
    Display horizontally on desktop and responsively wrap/stack on mobile.
    
    IMAGE:
    - Automatically pull the selected product image.
    - Use object-fit: contain with no cropping.
    - Allow custom image override and adjustable image scale.
    
    ADD TO BAG + CART DRAWER:
    IMPORTANT: The Add to Bag button must use the Luxe theme's existing AJAX cart/cart drawer behavior.
    
    - Do NOT redirect the customer to /cart.
    - Do NOT use a standard product form submission that reloads the page.
    - When Add to Bag is clicked, add the selected variant asynchronously using the same cart functionality already used by the Luxe theme.
    - After the item is successfully added, automatically open the EXISTING Luxe theme cart drawer.
    - Update the cart drawer contents and cart count/bubble immediately.
    - Reuse the theme's existing product-form, cart drawer, cart notification, events, classes, and JavaScript APIs wherever possible instead of creating a separate cart system.
    - Do not create a second custom cart drawer.
    - Prevent default form submission/navigation to the cart page.
    - Preserve variant ID, quantity, selling plan, and product properties when applicable.
    - The behavior should match the Add to Bag buttons already used elsewhere in the Luxe theme.
    
    CUSTOMIZATION:
    Include Theme Editor controls for:
    - Product picker
    - Section heading/subheading/link
    - Custom product title/description
    - Learn More text + URL
    - Green frame color
    - Content and image background colors
    - Text/icon colors
    - Badge text, icons, links, and colors
    - Button colors and hover colors
    - Section/column spacing
    - Image scale
    - Mobile column order
    - Independent alignment controls for header, product content, callouts, button, and image
    
    TYPOGRAPHY:
    All text must inherit the existing Luxe theme/site typography. Do not introduce new fonts. Match the site's existing headings, body copy, links, badges, prices, and buttons.
    
    TECHNICAL:
    - Preserve existing Luxe theme functionality/classes whenever possible.
    - Scope custom CSS/JS to this section.
    - Multiple instances must work without conflicts.
    - All content, icons, links, colors, spacing, and alignment should be editable through the Theme Editor.
    
    FINAL GOAL:
    Keep the appearance and functionality of the existing Luxe Featured Product section, but add the green frame, optional section header, linked icon callouts, expanded alignment controls, and icon/text benefit row above Add to Bag. Add to Bag MUST add the item via AJAX and open the existing Luxe cart drawer without navigating to the cart page., remove the 4th call out and add a customizeable product badge label
{% enddoc %}
